    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manase ea biyeara",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geeloosa Manase, aba gideaba niny duweacheeda Yosefu gil, ea ghwahita Makiri was duweacheeda Manase, ghweanda Gileyadi geeloosa Gileyadi ea Bashani, aba gideaba niny siida nal ng'ucheeda gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak iidu geesin loota aba fuga abit bea Manase, ea fugeaba gheanyi, nea Abieseri gil ea Heleki ea Asrieli, ea Shekemu, ea Heferi, ea Shemida; suh orjooga Manase gil was orjeeda Yosefu, sea fugeaba gheanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Selofehadi was orjeeda Heferi Gileyadeeda Makireeda Manase, abeeda ea mandeawana orjooga ghoaghus haweega; ak suh ea gheawunga haweega gil: Mala, ea Noa, ea Hogla, ea Milka, ea Dirsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geapka madeeda Eleasari was ashoohoocheanda ea Yoshuwa orjeeda Nuni, ea fuga hees, ak geeyeesha, “NG'UTAMIIDA ghayi gwarukusa Musa gagooneasa hearaniischooda sea fugaasa siduupcheewi.” Hean aba badaydeaba ng'asheanji bea NG'UTAMIIDEAN ghoadaw saawa gwahearaniischi aba bugusta fuga duupchi ghweaniga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak iidu geataw Manase nea geeloosa ng'eanyooji damanamughuush nea sheageewa ng'eanyiida Gileyadi ea Bashani, nea gwaduukusa meatkweeda Yordani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba haweega Manase ghwanyas hearaniischooda orjoagaaschi. Ak ng'eanyiida Gileyadi abeeda geeloosa fuga Manase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'eanyiida silaksa Manase ghang'eada Asheri ea ghwahita Mikmeta, mida dirbeayda Shekemu; hean gawa moonghooda ea ghwahita wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara bea ng'eanyiida fuga Entapua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'eanyiini bea fuga Dabuwaan ghayi gaba Manase, nea mujiineeda Dabuwa mida moonghooda Manase gaba orjooga Efraimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa moonghooda ghwararang'aada ea ghwahita eenda Gana. Ak mujiinajeega mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara bea eendean mida bugusta mujiinajeega Manasehiin gaba Efraimu. Hean gawa moonghooda Manase meatkweeda wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa bea eenda ak gamuudeana basooda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'eanyiida was wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara gaba Efraimu ak wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa gaba Manase, ak basooda ea moonghoadaanyi gil, ak wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa gaba Asheri, nea meatkweeda ghayeawa gaba Isakari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase abeeda mujiinajeagaaschi gwanda jeeda Isakari ea jeeda Asheri, nea Bet-sheni gil ea gharang'weakaaschi, ea Ibleamu ea gharang'weakaaschi, ea ng'eanyiida fuga Dori ea gharang'weakaaschi ea ng'eanyiida fuga Endori ea gharang'weakaaschi, ea ng'eanyiida fuga Daanaki ea gharang'weakaaschi ea ng'eanyiida fuga Megido ea gharang'weakaaschi; ak deaba samwagu ea Nafati gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak orjooga Manase ea mii ghwanyas hoorgeeda aba mujiinajeesu; aba gideaba fuga Ganaani ghoang'waay geat ak goobiida ng'eanyiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwanyas uurda fuga Israeli, hean geanung' gwasin fuga Ganaani gadiyeeda hang'waay, ak ea mutghahoan saawa aba jeedeaba ng'eanyiita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Efraimu ea Manase gagasa ng'eanyiida nuut",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobalool eemeeda Yosefu Yoshuwa, nea geeyeesha, “Ghwasaan anda gigoonyean loodidagi ea hijagi bea ng'eanyiida dahearan, aba gideaba aniini geawooschi eemeeda haw bea buuneeda, aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA nigoonan ghawooda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yoshuwa ak gwayeesha saawa, “Iwoosi eemeeda saang'a siyeeng'da una dareabeeta, ak giibuusi ng'eanyiida aba hoowa heechea abiidana aba jeeda ng'eanyiida fuga Beresi ea Refayimu, ea ghang'eada ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea Efraimu iimageandaneey.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda eemeeda Yosefu ak gwayeesha, “Ng'eanyiida heayeeniga maygageandaneasa; fuga sean bea Ganaani deabiidana mooheeda aba gideaba gwandeawa mutukwajeega gharinga, suh sean mida Bet-sheni, ea gharang'weaka nyaawa ea gea mida moangoachiyda Yesreeli sean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Yoshuwa fuga gheeh Yosefu, ea ghoah Efraimu ea Manase, “Goowooschi eemeeda saang'a, ak goondeawi uurda haw mwajealoanyi nibwagi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea ng'eanyiini bea heayeeniga gayghoah deang'wa, earapeadi dareabeeta gil, gajabuusa ak goopiidi moonghoadaanyi; ak gayhoana gwarita fuga Ganaani; earapeadi mideawa mutukwajeega gharinga earapeadi mideawa uurjeenga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
